type: software
title: "mfpvector: analysis code and molecular-dynamics run parameters for PFAS sorption to fluoropolymer microplastics"
abstract: >-
  Analysis scripts, molecular-dynamics driver and run parameters, docking
  configuration, Monte Carlo fluorine mass-balance script and per-replicate
  interaction-energy outputs and umbrella-sampling PMF data supporting the microfluoroplastics manuscript.
